Validation-only backport of the test_wrong_cert_tls13 assertion from:
https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/ea9a296fce2f786b4cf43c7924e5de01061f27ca
https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/a214f55b274df9782e78e99516a372e0b800162a

Only accept upstream's specific TLS/transport closure reasons, and additionally
require the server to report rejection of the untrusted certificate. A trusted
client must still exchange data with CERT_REQUIRED under TLS 1.3.
No interpreter changes; applied to a private copy of the installed test package.

